---
description: UI, styling, and accessibility
globs: app/**/*.tsx,components/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---
- Tailwind only: no inline styles, no new CSS files.
- Mobile-first: base styles, then sm:/md:/lg:.
- Reusable UI goes in /components, one component per file, PascalCase names.
- Use next/image with alt text, next/link for internal links.
- Use semantic HTML (main, section, nav, header, footer) and one h1 per page.
- Buttons and links must be keyboard accessible with visible focus states.
